{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hynek/structlog/pulls/786","id":3260603586,"node_id":"PR_kwDOALhqyM7CWNzC","html_url":"https://github.com/hynek/structlog/pull/786","diff_url":"https://github.com/hynek/structlog/pull/786.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hynek/structlog/pull/786.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hynek/structlog/issues/786","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hynek/structlog/pulls/786/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hynek/structlog/pulls/786/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hynek/structlog/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hynek/structlog/issues/786/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hynek/structlog/statuses/0f230f3ef1894c5b99e562e2950eeea814b8b5d5","number":786,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add name attribute to BytesLogger","user":{"login":"veeceey","id":34209028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MjA5MDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34209028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey","html_url":"https://github.com/veeceey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veeceey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Fixes `AttributeError: 'BytesLogger' object has no attribute 'name'` when using `add_logger_name` processor with `BytesLoggerFactory` (closes #734)\n- Adds a `name` slot to `BytesLogger` and accepts it as a keyword-only argument in `__init__`\n- Updates `BytesLoggerFactory.__call__` to forward the first positional argument (the logger name from `get_logger()`) to `BytesLogger`\n\n## Details\n\nAs reported in #734, using `structlog.stdlib.add_logger_name` with `BytesLoggerFactory` crashes because `BytesLogger` has no `name` attribute. The `add_logger_name` processor accesses `logger.name` when no `_record` is present in the event dict.\n\nThis implements the fix suggested by @hynek in https://github.com/hynek/structlog/issues/734#issuecomment-2499738291 with one additional safety guard: `BytesLoggerFactory.__call__` uses `args[0] if args else None` to avoid an `IndexError` when no positional arguments are passed to the factory.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Added `TestBytesLogger::test_name_attribute` -- verifies BytesLogger accepts a name kwarg\n- [x] Added `TestBytesLogger::test_name_defaults_to_none` -- verifies default is None\n- [x] Added `TestBytesLoggerFactory::test_passes_name_from_args` -- verifies factory forwards name\n- [x] Added `TestBytesLoggerFactory::test_name_defaults_to_none` -- verifies no-arg case\n- [x] Added `TestBytesLoggerFactory::test_extra_args_ignored` -- verifies extra args beyond first are ignored\n- [x] Added `TestAddLoggerName::test_logger_name_added_with_bytes_logger` -- end-to-end test with named BytesLogger\n- [x] Added `TestAddLoggerName::test_logger_name_none_with_unnamed_bytes_logger` -- end-to-end test with unnamed BytesLogger\n- [x] All existing tests pass (125 in test_output.py, 139 in test_stdlib.py)","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-08T23:01:45Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T13:32:41Z","closed_at":"2026-05-10T13:32:40Z","merged_at":"2026-05-10T13:32:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"3763c623c1a230b40fc2bd9cfcd1266f3a31b7a6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"veeceey:fix/issue-734